  "body": "\\section*{Mixed include root}\\label{_ee9e2e312259dcbf00117d7885b2e6eec3f9ebb}\n\\addcontentsline{toc}{section}{Mixed include root}\n\nThe chain crosses a notebook and returns to Markdown. See Figure~\\ref{_2dcf73d91276a31c78b4fd2478de23580a6f508}.\n\n\\subsection*{Notebook in the chain}\\label{_ff174fcb6156c430867aee7ad4e8f65f6035888}\n\\addcontentsline{toc}{subsection}{Notebook in the chain}\n\nThis notebook includes the Markdown part below.\n\nPart A keeps its own file-scoped note.\\footnote{This note belongs to part-a.md, not the including notebook.}\n\n\\section*{Part B}\\label{_ac0360d2ceb1f6555754d2e2633ee67a1f60eca}\n\\addcontentsline{toc}{section}{Part B}\n\n\\begin{figure}[htbp]\n\\centering\n\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=\\textheight,keepaspectratio]{paper.final_assets/plot.png}\n\\caption{Part B}\\label{_2dcf73d91276a31c78b4fd2478de23580a6f508}\n\\end{figure}\n\nThe root continues after the included notebook.\n",
